@startuml
title AI Processing Layer Sequence Diagram

actor "Ingestor Service" as Ingestor
participant "Agents-api" as AgentsAPI
participant "LLM Service (Watsonx)" as LLM
participant "RAG Connector Service" as RAG
participant "Rule-based Engine (future use)" as RuleEngine
participant "DB" as DB

Ingestor -> AgentsAPI: Send normalized logs (traps/syslogs)
AgentsAPI -> LLM: Send input log with context\n(return explanation, classification)
LLM --> AgentsAPI: Return explanation & severity
AgentsAPI -> RAG: Query relevant knowledge base entries
RAG --> AgentsAPI: Return matching MIB, vendor docs, past alerts
AgentsAPI -> RuleEngine: Apply rules for quick fixes\n(e.g. interface down → check cable)
RuleEngine --> AgentsAPI: Recommendations
AgentsAPI --> DB: Store processed output\n(explanation + suggested actions)

@enduml

